%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67d75f3915da58d41a1d291f85b93990, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 283005983412453505
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4224512499712
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224755769344
    m_Localized: I haven't eaten in so long... If it's not too much trouble, could
      you whip something up for me? I've got a bit of bacon left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224764157952
    m_Localized: "Crispy or burnt, it doesn't really matter\u2014and don't forget
      to bring \"a plate\" so I can share some with you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224764157953
    m_Localized: "You did great. It might not be anything fancy, but thank you for
      making the effort\u2014I'm definitely going to enjoy this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546560
    m_Localized: I think I'll be full for a long time now, so thank you so much,
      truly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546561
    m_Localized: Maybe you missing something?.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546562
    m_Localized: Last one ,A bit of meat, an egg, and some bacon... that doesn't
      sound like too much for you right now, does it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546563
    m_Localized: So this is really the end, Just meat, egg and bacon basic things
      isn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546564
    m_Localized: Thank you so much for staying with me all the way to this point.
      Thank you for making it through life this far, for being right here. You're
      seriously, damn incredible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546565
    m_Localized: Thank you so much for staying with me all the way to this point.
      Thank you for making it through life this far, for being right here. You're
      seriously, damn incredible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546566
    m_Localized: Let's see that bacon first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546567
    m_Localized: Yes please, just egg on a plate that should be enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546568
    m_Localized: Is there really anything better than a crispy fried egg with a runny
      yolk on a freezing day? I guess there probably is... I just can't think of
      a single thing right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546569
    m_Localized: It really does taste better than any other day, doesn't it? I wonder
      why... Why did it never taste this good before?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546570
    m_Localized: You know what came before the chicken or the egg? It's the fact
      that neither of them existed, and there was never any meaning to convey in
      the first place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546571
    m_Localized: Maybe you're missing someperson?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546572
    m_Localized: I've eaten raw fish all week. Cook one for me, would you? Bring
      it on a plate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546573
    m_Localized: (Still dreaming of that cooked fish.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546574
    m_Localized: "You know, evil is actually a necessary form of existence, isn't
      it? But then again, it's not like we have to become better tomorrow, right?
      Thank you so much\u2014thank you from the very bottom of my heart."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546575
    m_Localized: I really wish I could go to the beach too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546576
    m_Localized: Fish first. I've been waiting all week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546577
    m_Localized: Sometimes I just want to try something a little strange... maybe
      I'll stick to just vegetables this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546578
    m_Localized: Just lettuce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546579
    m_Localized: I know, right? To think that a color like green is what brought
      us all the way to this very day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546580
    m_Localized: Lettuce and company. Fine by me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546581
    m_Localized: Do you know how to cook? You're wondering about that too, huh? Well...
      yeah, it's you we're talking about, so one day you "will" figure it out anyway
      huh?.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546582
    m_Localized: Of course you can... So, how about we try making this pretty useless
      piece of food look a little better? I can't quite remember what it's called,
      though...flying? fleeing? 'Frying', was it?.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546583
    m_Localized: "A shiny, oil-glazed red sausage with a nice crispy skin\u2014and
      of course, the most important part... a plate."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546584
    m_Localized: No wonder everyone loves this useless little thing so much. Since
      when did it start tasting this good? Thanks, that was really delicious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546585
    m_Localized: Look at that, it actually turned out to be useful after all, ha!
      Thx bud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546586
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546587
    m_Localized: After eating stuff with zero nutritional value, guess it's time
      for something actually good... Let's go with cooked steak this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546588
    m_Localized: The steak. Don't need to be rush.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546589
    m_Localized: Maybe... someday, these familiar feelings and the same old tastes
      might feel entirely new again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546590
    m_Localized: I wonder when I'll get to eat something like this again...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546591
    m_Localized: someone?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 283005983412453505
  - m_Id: 4224772546592
    m_Localized: Wait, wasn't I just...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546593
    m_Localized: That face really brings back memories... the look of someone trying
      their best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546594
    m_Localized: "You know, maybe everything happened a bit too fast... for you,
      for me, for all of us. But hey, I\u2019m right here now, and you\u2019re here
      with us too. So maybe, if you just \"stand still for a moment\", you might
      figure out what to do next. Or you could just take a \"seat\" somewhere around
      here and think it over."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546595
    m_Localized: "You know, it feels like I used to make that exact face you're making
      so many times, a long, long time ago. A really long time ago\u2014even though
      I don't even have a face."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546598
    m_Localized: chat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546599
    m_Localized: someperson?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546600
    m_Localized: Hm? Oh. It's you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546601
    m_Localized: ...Yes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546602
    m_Localized: Is there anything that could help you out? Hmm... maybe... a record
      player?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546603
    m_Localized: You know how to fry black-fleshed chicken and actually tell when
      it's cooked or not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546606
    m_Localized: talk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546607
    m_Localized: somebody?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546608
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546609
    m_Localized: Glad to see you again. Which round is this now... -1, was it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546610
    m_Localized: If there's anything you want to do or ask for... just go ahead and
      ask. Nobody's going to judge you here. At least, not in this place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546611
    m_Localized: "We don't have names, but we still feel hunger. We don't really
      exist, but we still feel. And we won't have any answers\u2014not if we don't
      even know how to ask the questions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546614
    m_Localized: Speak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546615
    m_Localized: Anything I can do for you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546616
    m_Localized: About that order...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546617
    m_Localized: Here's your order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546618
    m_Localized: '{0}, please.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546619
    m_Localized: Bye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546620
    m_Localized: Bacon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546621
    m_Localized: Egg
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546622
    m_Localized: Fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546623
    m_Localized: Lettuce
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546624
    m_Localized: Sausage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4224772546625
    m_Localized: Steak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63091481059328
    m_Localized: Oh... for me? Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63091673997312
    m_Localized: I'll take it. Thanks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63091673997313
    m_Localized: Huh. You didn't have to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3662186790014976
    m_Localized: Your fridge is full. Make some room first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3667749989011456
    m_Localized: '{0} is in your fridge now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 283005983412453505
  references:
    version: 2
